# Performance Rules

See DEVELOPER.md "Performance (Phase 9)" for details.

## Frontend
- ApiCache + in-flight dedup (frontend/js/cache.js)
- Lazy load: analytics, visualizations, education via ModuleLoader
- VirtualList for 40+ blocks; chain preview shows last 15 only
- Scheduler.schedule for batched DOM; fingerprint diff before re-render
- Pause polling when tab hidden (Scheduler.createPoller)
- GET /blocks?summary=true for lightweight payloads

## Backend
- Balance cache rebuilt on mutation (blockchain.py)
- Block summary serialization without tx bodies
- Cache-Control on /stats
- Quiet validation on stats endpoint

## Avoid
- Fetching full blocks when summaries suffice
- Polling inactive views
- Loading Chart.js on initial page load
- Full table innerHTML rebuild when data unchanged

Do not sacrifice correctness for speed (validation must remain complete).
